# 統一行尾，避免 Windows 工作副本持續出現 LF→CRLF 轉換警告，
# 也避免不同平台的行尾差異造成無意義的整檔 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 程式碼與設定
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.cjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# 必須保持位元組原樣的檔案
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.odt binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
